cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "VinaStudio"
abstract: >-
  VinaStudio is a desktop Python/PySide6 application for virtual molecular docking,
  dual-target selectivity analysis, interaction profiling, and session-based scientific
  workflow management for MexAB/MexR-related drug-discovery studies.

version: 1.1.0
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
